      <groundspeak:logs>
        <groundspeak:log id="1308620331">
          <groundspeak:date>2025-07-04T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="25790230">MaybeSunshine</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP639 Makers' Madness Flash Cap [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Historically I cache more in June than in any other month, but not so much the June we just left. For whatever reason I feel like I’ve been enjoying the caps more than the caches lately, smileys or not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tonight I had no luck at BCP120 south of here (it seems a lot has changed at that GZ in 8 years), but this one is pretty much just happily sitting above ground level waiting to be found. In nice shape too. TFTCap.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
